  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{-\\tan 10 x^2+x^2 \\tan 10}{\\sin ^2 x} \\quad \\text { (Applying series) } \\\\ & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{-\\left(10 x^2+\\frac{10^3 x^6}{3}\\right)+x^2 \\tan 10}{x^2\\left(1-\\frac{x^2}{6}\\right)^2}=\\tan 10-10\\end{aligned}$"
